<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Therefore, now that you have witnessed their happy ending, my duty has been fulfilled, and this is <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's final destination.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama no longer has any business in this world, is that not so?<PG>
Then, goodbye.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
